    <section class="mb-12 space-y-6">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-white tracking-tight">
        8. Migration Checklist: Moving Production Workloads from SuiteCRM or HubSpot to EspoCRM
      </h2>
      <p class="text-sm text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
        Transitioning legacy CRM assets into EspoCRM requires an orderly sequence of data mapping, relationship reconciliation, and custom field validation. Follow this four-stage production cutover runbook:
      </p>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4 text-xs text-slate-300">
        <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800">
          <span class="text-emerald-400 font-mono font-bold block mb-1">Phase 1: Entity &amp; Field Schema Mapping</span>
          <p class="leading-relaxed text-slate-400">
            Export vardef definitions from SuiteCRM or property dictionaries from HubSpot. In EspoCRM Administration &rarr; Entity Manager, create corresponding entity attributes. Standardize enum field values and date formats (ISO 8601 UTC) prior to CSV data extraction.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800">
          <span class="text-emerald-400 font-mono font-bold block mb-1">Phase 2: Relational Integrity &amp; Foreign Keys</span>
          <p class="leading-relaxed text-slate-400">
            Ingest parent accounts and contacts before child entities (opportunities, cases, lead records). Preserve legacy UUIDs by populating a dedicated indexed custom field (<code class="text-cyan-400 font-mono">legacy_id_c</code>) to maintain bidirectional traceability.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800">
          <span class="text-emerald-400 font-mono font-bold block mb-1">Phase 3: Webhook &amp; Integration Rerouting</span>
          <p class="leading-relaxed text-slate-400">
            Update marketing form webhook endpoints and website lead funnels to hit the EspoCRM <code class="text-cyan-400 font-mono">/api/v1/Lead</code> endpoint with static API token headers. Validate inbound lead delivery latency remains sub-100ms.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800">
          <span class="text-emerald-400 font-mono font-bold block mb-1">Phase 4: Automated S3 Backups &amp; Cron Scheduling</span>
          <p class="leading-relaxed text-slate-400">
            Configure system cron to invoke EspoCRM's <code class="text-cyan-400 font-mono">cron.php</code> every minute. Deploy an automated nightly backup script using <code class="text-cyan-400 font-mono">mariadb-dump</code> with gzip compression piped directly to Cloudflare R2 object storage.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

